comment = "Capability-mode DEVICE provider"

desc = <<EOD
The [DEVICE] capability bundle, installed with its public client library.  It
brokers raw /dev device nodes: on request it opens a named leaf beneath the
directory descriptor serviced delivers, narrows the descriptor to exactly the
per-label policy rights (with an optional ioctl-command whitelist), and hands it
back over the caller's capability channel.  Default-deny.
EOD
